**Flow:**

1. User → Route 53
2. Route 53 → ALB
3. ALB → EC2/EKS Application
4. Application → RDS/DynamoDB
5. Logs → CloudWatch
6. Secrets → Secrets Manager
7. Images → ECR
8. CI/CD → Jenkins/CodePipeline
9. Infrastructure → Terraform
10. Monitoring → CloudWatch + SNS Alerts

This architecture and these services cover about **80–90% of the AWS services commonly discussed in DevOps L2 interviews**.
